            "en": "“आमरणम्,” you say, “until death,” and the twentieth statue's lantern lights, with a small calm flame. “यथाशक्ति,” she says. “I will keep it as far as I can.” She lowers the lamp. The hall gets a little brighter, each lamp leaning towards hers, as if the news had come to them: someone is going to keep the light on, every day, until the end.",
